{
  "chunk_id": "p2_about_hospital",
  "page_number": 2,
  "type": "section_text",
  "title": "ABOUT THE HOSPITAL",
  "content": "For over two decades, Dharamshila Narayana Superspeciality Hospital \n(earlier known as Dharamshila Hospital And Research Centre) at \nVasundhara Enclave in Delhi-NCR region was at the forefront of \ncancertreatment. Few Pioneering steps into the credit of Dharamshila \nNarayna Superspeciality Hospital is North India’s First Cancer Hospital \ncommissioned in 1994 with 200 beds, with the same objective of \nmaking Cancer Care Available, Accessible and Aordable. The Hospital \nis the rst cancer hospital in India to get NABH Accreditation in 2008 \nfor providing quality healthcare services. Our Laboratory Services are \nalso accredited by National Accreditation Board for Testing and \nCalibration Laboratories (NABL). Dharamshila Narayana Hospital is the \nrst hospital in India, given accreditation by National Board of \nExamination (NBE) for the Diplomate National Board (DNB) \nProgramme in medical in 2001 and surgical & radiation oncology in \n2004 respectively. Dharamshila Narayana is the rst hospital of North \nIndia to start Post Basic Diploma in Oncology Nursing (PBDON) in \n2010. \nOn 1st April 2017, the unit began its partnership with Narayana \nHealth, one of India's largest network of hospitals and heart centres \nand started operations as Dharamshila Narayana Superspeciality \nHospital. \nDharamshila Narayana Superspeciality Hospital is now a \nState-of-the-Art Multi Superspeciality Hospital with world-class \nmedical infrastructure and an expert team of highly skilled doctors \nproviding comprehensive medical care in more than 30 streams of \nclinical specialities including Bone Marrow Transplants, Cardiac \nSciences, Gastro sciences, Liver Transplants Oncology, Orthopaedics, \nNeurosciences, Nephrology & Kidney Transplant, Urology. \nWith a rich legacy of upholding trust and providing innovative \ntreatment approaches, Dharamshila Narayana Superspeciality \nHospital has become one of the most preferred destinations for \nmedical treatment in India."
},
